<title>NETHERLANDS: LCI Computer signs distribution agreement.</title>
<headline>LCI Computer signs distribution agreement.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German based Fujitsu Deutschland GmbH has signed an extensive printer distribution agreement with the Dutch LCI Group to take effect immediately.</p>
<p>According to Fujitsu Deutschland's General Manager, Hirtonobu Nishikori, this new contract includes the sale of Fujitsu's newest professional laser printer models PrintPartner 10 and 14 through LCI's expanding distribution network throughout Europe.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
